{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22828","headline":"题山石榴花 · 白居易","name":"题山石榴花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一丛千朵压阑干，翦碎红绡却作团。\n风嫋舞腰香不尽，露销妆脸泪新乾。\n蔷薇带刺攀应嬾，菡萏生泥玩亦难。\n争及此花檐户下，任人采弄尽人看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22828.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22828","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}